    "Issues (%lld)": {
      "comment": "Health issues section header with count.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "问题（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ownership ambiguous: distinct copies of this name disagree, so attribution is voided and the skill is treated as ownerless. Ledger claims below are data, not verdicts.": {
      "comment": "Library detail notice for ambiguous-name skills (attribution voided per D23).",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所有权存在歧义：同名技能的多个副本内容不一致，归属判定已作废，该技能按无归属处理。下方的账本声明仅供参考，不代表判定结果。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Library data": {
      "comment": "Settings section: refresh control.",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "库数据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Re-reads the library from disk (⌘R). External changes appear only after Refresh.": {
      "comment": "Settings refresh explanation (no filesystem watchers).",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从磁盘重新读取技能库（⌘R）。外部更改仅在刷新后显示。"
          }
        }
      }
